      "title": "[Boing Boing] Adam Savage is gobsmacked by this hand-drawn Enterprise cutaway",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SavageEnterprise-1.jpg?fit=1500%2C1000&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SavageEnterprise-1.jpg?fit=1500%2C1000&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SavageEnterprise-1.jpg?fit=1500%2C1000&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SavageEnterprise-1.jpg?fit=1500%2C1000&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/08/12/adam-savage-is-gobsmacked-by-this-hand-drawn-enterprise-cuta.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Adam Savage is gobsmacked by this hand-drawn Enterprise cutaway\"><img alt=\"Adam Savage Enterprise cutaway — Image via YouTube\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SavageEnterprise-1.jpg?fit=1500%2C1000&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;\" width=\"1500\" /></a><figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n\n</div>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you've ever been wowed by a cutaway illustration of a ship from your favorite sci-fi series or movie, there's a pretty good chance Matt Cushman had something to do with it. His visualizations of the guts of ships from Star Wars and Star Trek are astounding in their detail and the thoughtfulness given to functional, interior design. &#8212; <a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/08/12/adam-savage-is-gobsmacked-by-this-hand-drawn-enterprise-cuta.html\">Read the rest </a></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/08/12/adam-savage-is-gobsmacked-by-this-hand-drawn-enterprise-cuta.html\">Adam Savage is gobsmacked by this hand-drawn Enterprise cutaway</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://boingboing.net\">Boing Boing</a>.</p>",
